silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_04_yoneda_for_integration_sections_01_integrated_representable_concrete_anchors#integratedrepresentableanchor silm:hasLongDescription "The IntegratedRepresentableAnchor is concretely, the central object of this section instantiated in the household story (Mittens, Pumpkin, Dr. Patel, 77 Maple Street, or the chart/chip/registry witnesses). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'central object of section', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
