silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_04_yoneda_for_integration_sections_01_integrated_representable_concrete_anchors#integrationmediator silm:hasLongDescription "The IntegrationMediator is concretely, the integration mediator from HouseholdKG to the relevant per-entity sub-apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'integration mediator iota_e', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
